# SZC-LAMBDA-IMAGE — Container-Image Lambdas Require Billed ECR Storage
#
# An image package needs an ECR repository, billed per GB-month after the first year. Zip packaging has no storage charge.
#
# GENERATED by tools/gen_kics_queries.js. Edit the spec there, not this file.
# The same rule is enforced at synth time by infra/nag/rules.ts; a parity test
